    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<strong>Kill The Lights!</strong> is a puzzle game where you toggle blocks in a particular pattern in hopes of turning them all off. Clicking one spot toggles on or off all the lights around it in a specific pattern like a &quot;+&quot; or &quot;x&quot;. Relax and get your flow on by clicking blocks until all the lights are out in Normal mode. But if you're up for a challenge, take on the computer who turns on blocks while you're turning them off. With 6, yes, 6! difficulty modes, can you beat what is labeled as &quot;Literally Impossible?&quot;<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Note that <strong>50%</strong> of all profit will be donated to various Environmental Organizations</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How Blocks Work:</h2><br>In Kill the Lights! When you click on a block that block and all blocks around it, in a particular pattern, will toggle.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062790/extras/0441cf664c10b6e176e09055829989e1.avif?t=1721077630\" width=616 height=174 /></span><br><br>By clicking on the square in the middle of the example, the blocks to the left, above, and right turn on, while the middle and bottom turn off.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shapes:</h2>There are 4 different shape puzzles.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Plus<br></li><li>X<br></li><li>Plus Across The Board<br></li><li>X Across The Board</li></ul><br>Each one provides a unique challenge. Can you beat them all?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Types</h2><br>You can play in two exciting Game Types, Arcade and Normal.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Arcade - The devilish computer explodes bombs in all kinds of shapes to keep you from turning everything out<br></li><li>Normal - Relax (kinda) and try to turn off all the lights without any evil interruptions.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Arcade Mode</h2><br>If you're up for the challenge (I dare you), you can take on the computer in various difficulty levels ranging from &quot;Very Easy&quot; to &quot;Literally Impossible.&quot; At your disposal though are three purchasable special moves.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Turn Off Row - Turns off all blocks in a single row<br></li><li>Turn Off Column - Turns off all blocks in a single column<br></li><li>Toggle 1 - Toggles 1 block on or off</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062790/extras/93d698b5039508836809d1cd3449d760.avif?t=1721077630\" width=616 height=347 /></span><br><br>As you play you will gain up to 25 moves to spend on these specials. How many moves will it take you to beat the computer? I dunno, you're just gonna have to find out!",
