s ranging from &quot;Very Easy&quot; to &quot;Literally Impossible.&quot; At your disposal though are three purchasable special moves.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Turn Off Row - Turns off all blocks in a single row<br></li><li>Turn Off Column - Turns off all blocks in a single column<br></li><li>Toggle 1 - Toggles 1 block on or off</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062790/extras/93d698b5039508836809d1cd3449d760.avif?t=1721077630\" width=616 height=347 /></span><br><br>As you play you will gain up to 25 moves to spend on these specials. How many moves will it take you to beat the computer? I dunno, you're just gonna have to find out!",
